      'The full chat window uses the entire conversation area, groups and searches history by project, and keeps the selected conversation attached to its composer. Replies use safe native Markdown styling for headings, lists, nested steps, quotations, tables, code, links, task markers, and multilingual text without a second model call. Long conversations support the mouse wheel, browser-style middle-button autoscroll, and a wider draggable scrollbar.': '完整聊天視窗會使用整個對話區域，依專案分組並搜尋歷史記錄，同時讓編輯框始終對應目前選取的對話。回覆使用安全的原生 Markdown 樣式顯示標題、清單、巢狀步驟、引文、表格、程式碼、連結、工作標記和多語言文字，無需第二次模型呼叫。長對話支援滑鼠滾輪、瀏覽器式中鍵自動捲動和更寬的可拖曳捲軸。',
      'OpenWand can scan local ChatGPT/Codex and Claude conversation files and present the conversations inside a full-width picker instead of a filesystem chooser. You choose the conversations before anything is added, and optional automatic sync remains local to the files already on your computer.': 'OpenWand 可以掃描本機 ChatGPT/Codex 和 Claude 對話檔案，並在全寬選擇器中顯示對話，而不是開啟檔案系統選擇器。在加入任何內容之前由你選擇對話；可選的自動同步也只處理電腦上既有的本機檔案。',
      'The optional Formatted Replies add-on can restyle an individual reply or every reply. The original remains available, the exact chat model stays beside the composer, and the formatting model appears in the format-button tooltip before a formatting call. OpenWand rejects or repairs output that drops visible source content. The built-in renderer remains available when no formatting model is desired.': '可選的「格式化回覆」附加元件可以重新呈現單一或全部回覆。原文始終可用；編輯框旁會保留確切的聊天模型，格式化按鈕的提示框則會在格式化呼叫前顯示格式化模型。如果輸出遺漏可見的來源內容，OpenWand 會拒絕或修復它。不需要格式化模型時仍可使用內建呈現器。',
      'Once OpenWand is running, add provider credentials in Settings → Connections, then choose the model route in Settings → LLM. If you need a no-cost option, start with Free API sources. Secrets are stored in the OS keychain, not in the config file.': 'OpenWand 執行後，請在<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>中新增提供者憑證，再到<strong>設定 → LLM</strong>中選擇模型路由。如需免費選項，請從免費 API 來源開始。密鑰會儲存在作業系統鑰匙圈，而不是設定檔中。',
      'Live agent sessions are the normal path. OpenWand can also import selected local ChatGPT/Codex and Claude conversations without contacting either provider, optionally sync changes from the moment automatic sync is enabled, and export an OpenWand chat as a new provider conversation without overwriting existing history.': '即時代理工作階段是正常路徑。OpenWand 也能在不聯絡提供者的情況下匯入選定的本機 ChatGPT/Codex 與 Claude 對話，可選擇從啟用自動同步的時刻起同步後續變化，並可將 OpenWand 聊天匯出為新的提供者對話，而不覆寫現有歷史。',
      'Conversation import, forward sync, and export operate on local compatibility files; they do not send a live request or replace the supported Codex app-server and Claude Agent SDK session flow.': '對話匯入、後續同步和匯出只會操作本機相容檔案；它們不會傳送即時請求，也不會取代受支援的 Codex app-server 與 Claude Agent SDK 工作階段流程。',
      'A selected reference for advanced source configuration.': '進階原始碼設定的精選參考。',
      'This page highlights advanced settings; .env.example is the complete source reference. API keys are not stored in .env. Enter them in Settings → Connections — they are saved to the OS keychain via keyring.': '本頁著重介紹進階設定；<code>.env.example</code> 才是完整的原始碼設定參考。API 金鑰不會儲存在 <code>.env</code> 中。請在<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>中輸入，OpenWand 會透過 <code>keyring</code> 將其儲存到作業系統鑰匙圈。',
      'Read your own settings with addon_setting("my-addon", "prefix", default) from core.addon_manager.': '使用 <code>core.addon_manager</code> 中的 <code>addon_setting("my-addon", "prefix", default)</code> 讀取附加元件自己的設定。',
      'Add a named custom connection': '新增具名自訂連線',
      'Open Settings → Connections, add a custom connection, and give it a recognizable name, base URL, and API key. Each connection receives a stable custom@<id> route, so you can keep multiple local servers, gateways, accounts, or deployments and choose the right one under Settings → LLM.': '開啟<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>，新增自訂連線，並設定容易辨識的名稱、基底 URL 和 API 金鑰。每個連線都會取得穩定的 <code>custom@&lt;id&gt;</code> 路由，因此可同時保留多個本機伺服器、閘道、帳戶或部署，再到<strong>設定 → LLM</strong>中選擇所需連線。',
      'Legacy environment setup': '舊版環境變數設定',
      'The singleton environment variables remain available for source builds and backward compatibility. Prefer named connections for normal setup.': '單一連線環境變數仍可用於原始碼建置和向後相容。一般設定請優先使用具名連線。',
      'Your provider API keys are the most sensitive thing OpenWand touches, so they get the strongest handling. Keys are not stored in .env or any config file — you enter them in Settings → Connections, and they are written to the operating system keychain via the keyring library (Windows Credential Manager, macOS Keychain, or Secret Service on Linux).': '提供者 API 金鑰是 OpenWand 接觸的最敏感資訊，因此會受到最嚴格的保護。金鑰不會儲存在 <code>.env</code> 或其他設定檔中；請在<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>中輸入，OpenWand 會透過 <code>keyring</code> 寫入作業系統鑰匙圈。',
      'OpenWand reaches most of these through its OpenAI-compatible client. Many have a dedicated provider route; account-specific or deployment-specific routes can use independently named custom connections when the provider exposes an OpenAI-compatible URL. Providers without that shape are usually easiest through OpenRouter or another compatible gateway. Add credentials in Settings → Connections, where they are stored in the OS keychain, then select the model route in Settings → LLM.': 'OpenWand 透過相容 OpenAI 的用戶端存取其中大多數。許多提供者有專用路由；若提供者公開相容 OpenAI 的 URL，帳戶或部署專屬路由可使用獨立命名的自訂連線。請在<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>中新增憑證，再到<strong>設定 → LLM</strong>中選擇模型路由。',
      'Enter your Groq API key in Settings → Connections. It is stored in the OS keychain.': '在<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>中輸入 Groq API 金鑰。金鑰會儲存在作業系統鑰匙圈中。',
      'Enter your key in Settings → Connections.': '在<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>中輸入金鑰。',
      'Sign in with OAuth under Settings → Connections, then choose the ChatGPT route and model. Tokens are stored in the OS keychain.': '在<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>中透過 OAuth 登入，再選擇 ChatGPT 路由和模型。權杖會儲存在作業系統鑰匙圈中。',
      'Enter your Google AI Studio API key in Settings → Connections.': '在<strong>設定 → 連線</strong>中輸入 Google AI Studio API 金鑰。',
